<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO's LaSalle Q3 net up seven pct.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO's LaSalle Q3 net up seven pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			    49.0  vs  45.9</p>
<p>Net income available to common  41.8  vs  38.4</p>
<p>    Net interest income		143.6  vs 126.3</p>
<p>    Non interest income		 71.4  vs  60.2</p>
<p>    Non interest expense	     124.2  vs 103.1</p>
<p>    Loss provision			20.2  vs  16.9</p>
<p>    Net chargeoffs			 8.0  vs   5.8</p>
<p>NOTE - LaSalle National Corp is a fully-owned unit of ABN AMRO Bank of the Netherlands. -- A'dam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
